WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.066 --> 00:00:18.933
Hello up there!

2
00:00:18.933 --> 00:00:22.373
Who are you?

3
00:00:22.373 --> 00:00:25.765
I'm a green iguana.

4
00:00:25.765 --> 00:00:31.619
Iguanas are a type of lizard.

5
00:00:31.619 --> 00:00:34.736
Where do you live?

6
00:00:34.736 --> 00:00:39.848
We live in warm places like Central America.

7
00:00:39.848 --> 00:00:44.887
The rain forest is our home.

8
00:00:44.887 --> 00:00:48.182
I like your spines.

9
00:00:48.182 --> 00:00:52.175
Our spines protect us from enemies.

10
00:00:52.175 --> 00:00:55.616
We have strong tails too.

11
00:00:55.616 --> 00:01:00.799
We use them to fight enemies.

12
00:01:00.799 --> 00:01:04.091
Your tail is very long.

13
00:01:04.092 --> 00:01:08.619
Sometimes we break off our tails.

14
00:01:08.619 --> 00:01:12.002
This helps us escape danger.

15
00:01:12.002 --> 00:01:18.081
Later we grow new tails.

16
00:01:18.081 --> 00:01:21.188
Do you like to climb?

17
00:01:21.189 --> 00:01:26.574
Yes! We use our claws to climb.

18
00:01:26.574 --> 00:01:31.896
We spend lots of time in trees.

19
00:01:31.897 --> 00:01:34.833
What do you eat?

20
00:01:34.833 --> 00:01:39.418
We eat leaves, fruit, and flowers.

21
00:01:39.418 --> 00:01:46.115
We have sharp teeth for chewing.

22
00:01:46.116 --> 00:01:49.060
Do you go in the water?

23
00:01:49.060 --> 00:01:54.098
Sometimes we hide from enemies in the water.

24
00:01:54.098 --> 00:01:59.895
We can stay underwater for a long time.

25
00:01:59.895 --> 00:02:03.667
Uh-oh! I hear a hawk.

26
00:02:03.667 --> 00:02:06.923
It's time for a swim.

27
00:02:06.923 --> 00:02:14.090
Good-bye, Green Iguana!
